    "title": "Madison and Chester each grab three 1st place finishes at Brookings Alumni Meet - NewsBreak",
    "text": "13 hours ago Madison turned in a strong all-around performance in Brookings on Tuesday, highlighted by three event titles. Leading the way was Shane Veenhof, who dominated the hurdles. Veenhof raced to a first-place finish in the 110-meter hurdles with a time of 15.10 and followed it up with a runner-up finish in the 300-meter hurdles (38.94). Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
